      "cooked": "<dl>\n<dd>\n<p>I wrote up this quick topic on BGG...just copying here for a broader audience&nbsp; :)</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance for any replies/discussion!</p>\n</dd>\n<dd>&nbsp;</dd>\n<dd>&nbsp;</dd>\n<dd>Hello!<br><br>I am looking to see which combo of decks&nbsp;are your favorite.<br><br>Which Villains work well with certain Environments or are just <b>fun </b>to play?&nbsp; You know?!&nbsp; WHich are just plain <strong>FUN </strong>together?!<br><br>I am just getting into this game and am really enjoying the possibilities.<br>Plus, my kids love it, too! A bonus!</dd>\n</dl><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
