      "id": 40683,
      "name": "Cosmonaut Zero",
      "username": "Cosmonaut_Zero",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/cosmonaut_zero/{size}/2520_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-10-22T05:20:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had a lot of fun with Akash'Buta in Tomb of Anubis. There's a lot of targets to proc AB's extra plays, so it can get kind of ridiculous. But that's the fun part.</p><p>Another fave of mine is Baron Blade on Wagner Mars Base. Thematically, it makes sense because then it's not a suicide run for him, and I like how it gives him a third victory condition.</p><p>It's just such a fun environment all-around. I love it thematically, and mechanically there's so much cool stuff crammed into there with the relics, and the nemesis icon on Anubis.</p>",
